    "title": "Iowa trolls Michigan after last-second Big Ten win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Heim ,\n9 hours ago No. 17 Iowa didn’t take long to troll No. 18 Michigan after the Hawkeyes’ last-second win in Ann Arbor 20-19. “No extra time necessary,” the Iowa Hawkeye football account posted on X. In the same stadium where Michigan was given an extra second in a controversial win... Read full article",
